，救鄭，敗晉兵於櫟。是時晉悼公為盟主。十八年，晉悼公彊，數會諸侯，率以伐秦，敗秦軍。秦軍走，晉兵追之，遂渡涇，至棫林而還。二十七年，景公如晉，與平公盟，已而背之。三十六年，楚公子圍弒其君而自立，是為靈王。景公母弟後子鍼有寵，景公母弟富，或譖之，恐誅，乃奔晉，車重千乘。晉平公曰：「后子富如此，何以自亡？」對曰：「秦公無道，畏誅，欲待其後世乃歸。」三十九年，楚靈王彊，會諸侯於申，為盟主，殺齊慶封。景公立四十年卒，子哀公立。后子復來歸秦。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-005","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p058","quote":"十四年，簡王崩，子靈王泄心立。靈王二十四年，齊崔杼弒其君莊公。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-004","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"}],"rationale":"所屬國家、王朝與敘事時代不同，按本文分開登記；共同稱號不足以支持合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p058","text":"十四年，簡王崩，子靈王泄心立。靈王二十四年，齊崔杼弒其君莊公。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m058-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"簡王","kind":"person","person_id":"s4y_bc6_4ay","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m058-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"靈王泄心","kind":"person","person_id":"6a7_li3_zwm","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m058-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"6a7_li3_zwm","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m058-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"崔杼","kind":"person","person_id":"xgd_r31_cmr","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m058-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m_AAAA","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p059","text":"二十七年，靈王崩，子景王貴立。景王十八年，后太子聖而蚤卒。二十年，景王愛子朝，欲立之，會崩，子丐之黨與爭立，國人立長子猛為王，子朝攻殺猛。猛為悼王。晉人攻子朝而立丐，是為敬王。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m059-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"6a7_li3_zwm","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m059-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"景王貴","kind":"person","person_id":"ary_z8m_f18","status":"source_identifie